WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two numbers flash. You recognize the first. The next may slip past.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers call this the attentional blink. The timing matters.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A three-month intensive meditation study found a smaller blink in one trained group.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But a controlled retreat is not a twelve-minute MP3, and no Zen12 benefit follows from that result.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try a free twelve-minute observation routine. See what it is like to practice consistently.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then make your own informed choice. The source is the story; a product is optional.
